{"format_version":"0.1","record_type":"person_source_bundle","requested_person_id":"cbr-p000731","identity_policy":"contextual_provisional","person_ids":["cbr-p000731"],"persons":[{"id":"cbr-p000731","label":"外黃令舍人兒","status":"active","historicity":"historical_tradition","aliases":[{"surface":"外黃令舍人兒","mention_ids":["c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m036-0032"]}],"evidence":[{"mention_id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m036-0032","chapter_id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:p036","quote":"外黃令舍人兒"}]}],"mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m036-0032","start":32,"end":38,"surface":"外黃令舍人兒","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000731","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:p036","chapter_id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu"}],"relations":[],"title_holdings":[],"address_assertions":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:p036","text":"外黃不下。數日，已降，項王怒，悉令男子年十五已上詣城東，欲阬之。外黃令舍人兒年十三，往說項王曰：「彭越彊劫外黃，外黃恐，故且降，待大王。大王至，又皆阬之，百姓豈有歸心？從此以東，梁地十餘城皆恐，莫肯下矣。」項王然其言，乃赦外黃當阬者。東至睢陽，聞之皆爭下項王。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m036-0011","start":11,"end":13,"surface":"項王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000610","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m036-0017","start":17,"end":19,"surface":"男子","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"官稱、匿名者、群體、動物或未定指代保留待核；不補姓名、闕代或個別成員。"},{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m036-0032","start":32,"end":38,"surface":"外黃令舍人兒","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000731","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m036-0044","start":44,"end":46,"surface":"項王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000610","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m036-0049","start":49,"end":51,"surface":"彭越","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000707","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m036-0077","start":77,